      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have found that this issue is related to display scaling.\nIn my environment, main display uses display scaling (125%) and others don't use scaling.\nWhen I use same scale for all displays, VRChat client worked expectedly.\nTherefore, the correct title of this issue is \"Client crashes when older settings use a monitor that uses different scaling from main monitor.\"",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
